      "construction": "\\(\\mathcal M_{I,J,d,k}(M,\\omega,c_{\\mathrm{sep}},\\kappa)=\\{(p,q,\\phi,\\Theta):p\\in\\Delta_I,\\ q\\in\\Delta_J,\\ \\Theta\\subset\\mathbb R^k\\text{ is nonempty and compact},\\ \\|\\phi_{ij}(\\theta)\\|_2\\le M,\\ \\|\\phi_{ij}(\\theta)-\\phi_{ij}(\\theta')\\|_2\\le\\omega(\\|\\theta-\\theta'\\|_2),\\ \\operatorname{Cover}(\\Theta,s)\\text{ is certified for every supplied }s>0,\\ \\Theta_0(p,q)\\ne\\varnothing,\\ D_0(\\theta;p,q)\\ge c_{\\mathrm{sep}}\\min\\{\\operatorname{dist}(\\theta,\\Theta_0(p,q))^\\kappa,1\\}\\ \\text{for all }1\\le i\\le I,\\ 1\\le j\\le J,\\ \\theta,\\theta'\\in\\Theta\\}\\).",
