      "gap": "Weed and Cominetti--San Martín analyze linear objectives; a vector-moment norm can have a minimizing set that is not a face of the transport polytope.",
      "consumer": "It yields a pointwise bias diagnostic for sensitivity tables while keeping uniform face-changing claims outside scope."
